  "subtitle": "Soft pork and beef meatballs in brown cream gravy",
  "excerpt": "Equal parts pork and beef mince are combined with soaked breadcrumbs and spiced with allspice and nutmeg, then pan-fried and served in a rich brown cream gravy. Kottbullar are Sweden's most famous dish. These are smaller and spicier than Italian meatballs -- the gravy is as important as the balls themselves.",
