        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "The soaked breadcrumbs are what make Swedish meatballs so soft. Give them 5 minutes in the milk before mixing. Roll the meatballs small -- about 3cm across -- so they cook through evenly in the pan. The gravy is made in the same pan after frying." }]
