      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Sweden. Eaten on Thursdays, at midsummer, and at the julbord (Christmas buffet). The Swedish version is smaller, softer, and spiced with allspice -- quite different from other European meatballs." }]
